a US radar as part of countering what it called hostile American activity.

00:15:05.887 --> 00:15:11.187
Papua New Guinea's prime minister told Xi Jinping it was not easy to close Taiwan's office.

00:15:11.187 --> 00:15:13.847
and that Taiwan no longer operates there.

