00:15:44.647 --> 00:15:50.947
A software bug at Chase disrupted U.S. transactions and delayed some Zell payments, a one-and-a-half-hour

00:15:50.947 --> 00:15:54.327
system outage forced United Airlines to hold departing flights.

00:15:54.987 --> 00:16:00.047
Liberia's only international airport added a third aircraft fuel truck after years of relying

00:16:00.047 --> 00:16:03.487
on two aging ones that delayed airlines whenever one broke.

00:16:03.487 --> 00:16:09.867
Modella Capital, which paid 76 million pounds last June for the old WH Smith High Street

00:16:09.867 --> 00:16:17.247
chain, now called TG Jones, plans to auction a business of about 3,500 jobs after 130 store

