closures.

00:16:18.247 --> 00:16:23.487
In Spain, data center policy has become an election fight that CNBC says is blocking

00:16:23.487 --> 00:16:27.247
existing deals and could put billions of dollars of investment at risk.

00:16:27.727 --> 00:16:32.767
In eastern Congo, health teams around Nisi are trying to slow what the New York Times called

00:16:32.767 --> 00:16:38.367
the fastest-growing Ebola outbreak on record, while families still want to nurse sick relatives at

00:16:38.367 --> 00:16:44.707
home. And Donald Trump landed in Manila for a state visit as the ASEAN summit. The association

00:16:44.707 --> 00:16:50.067
of Southeast Asian nations was already wrapping up, so he will miss most of it before he flies

00:16:50.067 --> 00:16:56.142
on to China. To really understand this week's Asia photographs separate three rooms that coverage

00:16:56.142 --> 00:17:03.362
keeps gluing together. APEC, the Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation Forum, is 21 member economies,

00:17:03.662 --> 00:17:10.442
mostly in the region, plus Canada, Mexico, Australia, Russia, and the United States. It promotes trade.

00:17:10.722 --> 00:17:15.762
It is not a free trade block, so it cannot by itself rewrite the tariffs members charge each

00:17:15.762 --> 00:17:21.722
other. Leaders meet yearly, and the host city rotates. ASEAN is the Southeast Asian grouping,

00:17:21.722 --> 00:17:24.122
who summit the Manila stop is attached to.

00:17:24.602 --> 00:17:30.302
The Quad is a smaller set of partners greeted on the same trip, a meeting, not a 21 economy

00:17:30.302 --> 00:17:31.042
trade body.

00:17:31.582 --> 00:17:36.442
A handshake in one room is not a decision of another, and that is how a photo gets inflated

00:17:36.442 --> 00:17:37.162
into a treaty.

00:17:37.802 --> 00:17:40.182
Side meetings often outweigh the formal agenda.

00:17:40.862 --> 00:17:43.102
This year's APEC host city is Shenzhen.

00:17:43.722 --> 00:17:48.722
Last year in Gyeongju, South Korea's president gave Trump a replica gold crown that researchers

00:17:48.722 --> 00:17:54.042
cultures believe an ancient ruler war, and Trump met Xi in nearby Busan, where the two

00:17:54.042 --> 00:17:55.762
called a truce in their trade war.

00:17:56.362 --> 00:17:58.182
The crown did not move a tariff line.

00:17:58.722 --> 00:18:03.762
The Busan talk did because it was two leaders beside the forum, not a vote of the 21.

00:18:04.402 --> 00:18:09.182
When a license rule, a tariff cut or a leader's picture is described as happening at the summit,

00:18:09.802 --> 00:18:15.502
check which body had the power to do it, APEC, ASEAN, the Quad, or two people in the corridor,

00:18:15.502 --> 00:18:20.422
door, and whether it looks like last year's Busan truce, a side deal the forum only hosted.

00:18:21.358 --> 00:18:27.038
The Guardian reports a 227 meter road arch in the water and debris that may block a shipping

00:18:27.038 --> 00:18:32.138
120 meters wide, while the New York Times says engineering teams were still measuring

00:18:32.138 --> 00:18:37.438
both the Crimean bridge and the Kiev bridges, and that the extent was not immediately clear.

00:18:38.058 --> 00:18:43.438
Thursday in Shenzhen is the session where Trump, Xi, and Putin are due to sit down, and

00:18:43.438 --> 00:18:47.098
